; The Throne's boss (.ai/endgame-castle.md 6.4), never named on screen: he takes a spell with a hand of his
; dark light, and the player takes it back from the orb it rides home in (ThroneDarkWizardBoss.cs, SealOrb,
; Player.Seal.cs). A caster who keeps his distance, a little slower than Elderbark; his ring is for a player
; who comes to his feet. He faces the player with his raised hand (SpriteFacesRightByDefault off: the art's
; raised arm is on its left). Health and the Arcane bonus are BossCatalog's [13] block.
